<title>JAPAN: Showa Denko to announce new president at 0700 GMT.</title>
<headline>Showa Denko to announce new president at 0700 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Major Japanese chemical producer Showa Denko KK said on Thursday that its president Makoto Murata would hold a news conference at 4 p.m. (0700 GMT) in Tokyo to announce his successor.</p>
</text>
